# service-account keys download as <project>-<hash>.json — never let one near a
# public repo. The real key lives outside the tree; CI reads it from a secret.
*-[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].json
